f-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Sibley County shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951, and July to August in 28. In 2025 the middle ran 14% of normal in January to February and 50% in September to October. So far in 2026 it shows 44% in January to February and 126% in June to July. Grid 29245 has a preliminary estimate of 87.0 for August to September 2026, which RMA&rsquo;s final index can change.</p>"}
